(text "Plugs into the main board on two 2.54 mm headers. Power pins: 4 per rail, about 3 A each." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 09a42a7e-3ae1-4f29-8006-90aeb7880b73))
(text "eFuse settings: OVP 31.8 V (255k/10k), current limit 6.0 A (3.01k), UVLO default 15.5 V, about 11 ms soft start at 24 V (22 nF)." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ebbe7465-b6f5-4061-9ea2-352b75fa22f1))
(text "MODE open = latch-off after an overload (default). Close JP to GND for auto-retry. SHDN left open (internal pull-up)." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 916c3af1-c222-48b6-9844-aab09546d221))
(text "PGTH and PGOOD are tied to GND (power-good unused; TI allows PGOOD at GND). FLT and IMON go to the main board." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9c34922a-06b8-4386-949a-91bfbe494bf8))
(text "Reverse polarity: Q1 blocks it (TI arrangement: Q1 source to IN_SYS, drain to IN, gate to B_GATE; Q2 pulls B_GATE down)." (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fb04acf3-0989-4911-b1d2-e3311fe68cd9))
(text "TVS SMCJ51CA: stays off with a 48 V supply plugged in by mistake; the eFuse OVP disconnects the board." (at 20.32 39.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3afcf430-ff8c-4830-ae4f-f85e09cabb52))
(text "TPS7A4901: +5VA = 1.185 V x (1 + 32.4k/10k) = 5.02 V. 10 nF on NR/SS and across the top resistor (CFF)." (at 20.32 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 49cdce2f-c72d-4606-8ce3-7ee40abf2435))
